/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/qmjKhSRGsbwzi27u59za5hGqTBl3mcrF.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_EventMission_Login_1","category":"event","text":"来确认一下进展吧。","text_original":"進捗を確認してみましょうか","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/f8OfGD5QRJXKyibGdjUyVogpUikvTVzw.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_EventMission_Login_2","category":"event","text":"是来确认进展吗？有什么我可以帮你的？","text_original":"確認に来たのね。何か手伝いましょうか?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/slKZLX9yeeRjXzuu84buVbbyHyvNU3FQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯……真的不要紧吗？","text_original":"ふーん?本当に大丈夫?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/RrY8ERFZTCKH4lTAcOlVtKEZWQPX1DPf.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"我本来没这个打算的……","text_original":"ここまでするつもりはなかったけど","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/X8q3zud3wxy2P9Srx6To7reGTcdG7Uko.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"唉，看来真的没办法了呢~","text_original":"ほんと、しょうがないんだから","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/ir51shsaX6OpLr375cFvWhOIcEXLMBCO.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"结果还是会变成这样啊。","text_original":"結局こうなっちゃうのよね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/y9MOnyJoN9k8GoGzeCaaPOhGqgQl8j1h.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"所以我不都说过了吗？","text_original":"だから、言ったじゃない?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/r7NwAyqFLxyTob4RhVGSbs4VvRH4uH4v.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"好啦，你就放手去做吧？","text_original":"好きにやってちょうだい","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/sqDP7FOy8lZfxAUqSlOTLzMRXmwhNXzQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"你也真是个奇怪的人呢。嗯，这当然不是贬义词哦。我一般不会信任没被我读过心的人……但对你的话，至少用不着怀疑吧？","text_original":"あなたも変わってるわね。ああ、悪い意味ではないのよ。普通は頭の中を読んでない相手のことなんて信じないんだけど。疑ってない程度ってことにしておこうかしら。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/SGd7tU0M5Wlu1vOmE38MEeiTmluG1OTt.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"我可不是冲锋陷阵的类型呀。","text_original":"前に出るタイプじゃないんだけどなぁ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/SJaJgWBCET3kobqMpWMDkHjgwF5WPz55.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"不过如果需要，我也不是不能帮你。","text_original":"必要って言うならやってあげるけど","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/o4gCQvVCjFhPDAiS46Vxut6nFJpeuk2w.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"哼~？","text_original":"何?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/eL6s99EcpSclundEbcjPxwFiwCKuImGh.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"咦，我应该自我介绍过了啊……难道你不记得了？呵呵。","text_original":"あら?自己紹介はしたはずだけど、もしかして覚えてないのかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/fzE4vsodV8srDpKAo9McoU8CrL6eQxD8.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"感觉还不错嘛？那……要我为你做点什么吗？","text_original":"悪くないかも?それで、私は何をすればいいのかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/wTWURRB4OQVtWrNuo5WDw4qucXnuNUAz.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我一般不喜欢欠人情……不过我会记住的。","text_original":"仮は作らない主義だけど…覚えておくわね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/zk1hnptfDEYBZpIQiPOaAeGP4ByrURiH.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"头脑好像清晰多了呢？","text_original":"頭がすっきりするって感じ?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/NrwdcsMsSDxbyGXa20XeKbCo3RqtE4Nu.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"感觉用起能力来好像轻松多了。……你很好奇吗？要不要来试一下？","text_original":"なんだか能力を使いやすくなったかも…ん?気になるなら試してみる?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/cHqFkilyPB02K5COtzgdH29yRg3m1XMl.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师的工作，似乎跟我了解的那种差不多，但又有些区别呢。","text_original":"先生のお仕事って私が知ってるものと同じようで違うのね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/ajJOHsakCeco0n59iZ8o0X7Ye3QNQ66G.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"工作一定很辛苦吧……要不要我来帮帮你？……当然，是用“普通的方式”。","text_original":"お仕事大変そうね?手伝いましょうか?もちろん、普通のやり方よ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/XpG4yxSrvhn6uM8xcEutuO5RhtPJX5Sh.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"其实，我现在还是有些头痛呢。","text_original":"実はまだ今も頭がちょっと痛むのよ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/WjPLZoIDTTGzgP1mYTsEdAqSeYgX3tTQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"遥控器？它对我确实很重要……但不代表它本身有什么特别之处哦？","text_original":"リモ君?確かに大事だけど、別にアレ自体に何かあるわけじゃないのよ?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/xpQ2UXGEFh6WEmsVlXuVY6McfaiZLtD5.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"说起来，这里有什么美食吗？如果有推荐的店，可不可以带我去？","text_original":"そういえばここって何が美味しいのかしら?おすすめのお店連れてってくれない?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/Uz4Rqa0dE0MSj9mmOfbPo5DVvHAfXUPk.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"你来啦，老师。……人家等你很久了哦☆","text_original":"いらっしゃい先生 こう見えて結構待ったんだぞ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/VMrU35NbDlTY6CvF1uu3NSiQCFVhvrwy.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？我只是刚好待在这里而已。毕竟没有向导，我也不太想出门呢。","text_original":"ん?なんとなくここに居ただけよ?ガイドもいないし、あんまり出かけたくなくって","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/wwClkT3cvZmIIJZl5F1q43JbkM4pn4KN.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……怎么了?","text_original":"なに?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/5ub0rDCrqPRLy8pwJu7YXdwHLrZKcD1J.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"出什么事了吗？","text_original":"どうかしたのかしら","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/e6rujRoKwgz8HOeCXyXTAqxKymhfKWjr.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"反正，我想这也是迟早的事。","text_original":"いずれにせよ、いつかこうなることだったと思うのだけど?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/TA4ImJtbJQNZFJkzr7rBXi7Kz1uScJMY.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"……对不对？","text_original":"そうでしょ?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/epKRCTXBHGOqz87w0xjGbaRimLjCRbZV.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"遥控器？ ……你确定要问这个吗？","text_original":"リモコン?それ、聞いちゃおう?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/H51dJGACmI1MXSWXkDiau5bjf2v4zz7B.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"不觉得这样有些欠考虑吗?","text_original":"ちょっと気配りが足りないかも","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/gqSpql7L2hfEhCS77HMD5x7MF5anKj8j.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"如果一件事女孩子不想说……","text_original":"女の子が話そうとしていないのだろう","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/9GMvtNVKavPbAQulRdHKdYu3GYrUpfF6.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"非要打破砂锅问到底可不好哦☆","text_original":"無理に聞こうとしちゃダメだぞ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/3teHCcdAAqPFl1Ou7lTLvnFnbbDphGm3.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"你什么都没看见，什么都没听见，什么都没发生。","text_original":"いい?あなたは何も見ていないし、そもそも何も起きてなかった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/PI8NDymP1eRBjSk9X1VA5Z5vXpVlb3rp.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……对吧，老师？","text_original":"そうよね 先生","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/3hSuetfursNjlzZfcpzA4zXeTFMK4SEp.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"你对其他人也是这样吗？呵呵……看来你相当有人气力呢。","text_original":"あなたって他の人にもこんな感じなの?これはきっと相当な人気力ね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/xSi6w3yJpRQNg6LAT4Hf5uo2JtEitWzD.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"唔……这也是出于“老师”的身份吗？","text_original":"ん? これも先生だからかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/8ysUfvxBNJ4UOs2DTl86evz8SwWbGEiX.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"偶尔会想读读看你脑子里的想法呢。……啊，我只是说说，又不是真的试过，你不用担心。","text_original":"たまには頭の中を覗きたいなぁと思っているのよ？あ、まだやってないから心配しないでちょうだい","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/xxssfxBRfXr0W0nx7zmsLOTjgMV3eHjR.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"我说……你对区区外来者是不是也太好了？","text_original":"ちょっと、よそ者相手にやりすぎじゃないかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/DbHnUQdvKswQigqskKGqxXOo1OISaGL9.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"今天是老师的生日吧？唔，该怎么为你庆祝呢。……顺便问一下，你有没有想和哪个人一起度过今天呢？","text_original":"先生のお誕生日よね?どう祝ってあげましょう。ちなみに一緒に過ごしたいことがいるかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/nsE84nv57f2DLXn9W6AWPIyq7QpjGKMn.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"外面真吵呀。嗯……不过在这里应该不要紧。","text_original":"外が騒がしいわね。まあ、ここなら構わないけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/q4srdIGSZftXbvy9KAVXnkuP1fqrLlrL.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师。……在这里，也是这样打招呼的没错吧？","text_original":"あけましておめでとう先生 ここでもこの挨拶であってるのかしら","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/gSLZZ9ZjnB24rJ8FDgCrEe5aHyniQnb4.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊……老师，你都当过几次圣诞老人呢？","text_original":"クリスマスね。先生は何回サントになったのかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/EMwt16maJVMVDvhjr0KR4IldKHOInh6W.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"だから言ったでしょ?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/P9NIzCUP0vw48BJKhtHdYcnjtSpaLoJ2.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"こういうのが得意な子に任せてよね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/xekc0dtLChXj2C32q2rc0K5dZd2ET9FB.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"圣诞节啊……老师，你都当过几次圣诞老人呢？","text_original":"あら?こんなこともするの?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/FPkLfi1LYFaZPnPe8hk1EAVWxw8qQuXE.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"好在我今天心情还不错呢。","text_original":"今日は機嫌が良くて助かったわね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/tSlySABK9ngwaMMwOFb2RBPGotzDTmrs.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"我都这么努力了……就没有什么奖励吗~？","text_original":"結構頑張ったんだけど何かご褒美はないのかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/92Q9WdqOQEfnWlfLjjXdTfIvyifeCG18.ogg"},{"description":"CH9997_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我可没说过做不到哦☆","text_original":"できないとは言ってないぞ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%9F%E8%9C%82%20%E6%93%8D%E7%A5%88/1mfcglsb7HjmiJptVTVvBDphFJuwDAr4.ogg"},{"descri